    "detailed_description": "The world is in peril, as thousands of demons are devastating the world and your village was the first victim.<br>In search of revenge you swear that you're ready to fight, even against the death itself.<br>Begin your journey as a Death Fighter and show the Death itself who's the boss !<br><br>This game is a 2D platformer and side scroller where you play a Death Fighter who wants to avenge his friends.<br>Death Fighter is made of three levels with different mechanics and ennemies to defeat by jumping on their head.<br>At the end of each level, you will fight and defeat a boss by jumping multiple times on their head and jump into a portal to go to the next level.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging and complex gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customizable difficulty from beginner to expert !</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlockable skins and rewards !</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Made by an indie game developer, with love !</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The world is in peril, as thousands of demons are devastating the world and your village was the first victim.<br>In search of revenge you swear that you're ready to fight, even against the death itself.<br>Begin your journey as a Death Fighter and show the Death itself who's the boss !<br><br>This game is a 2D platformer and side scroller where you play a Death Fighter who wants to avenge his friends.<br>Death Fighter is made of three levels with different mechanics and ennemies to defeat by jumping on their head.<br>At the end of each level, you will fight and defeat a boss by jumping multiple times on their head and jump into a portal to go to the next level.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging and complex gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customizable difficulty from beginner to expert !</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlockable skins and rewards !</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Made by an indie game developer, with love !</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a simple side-scroller made by one person. It's my first game and I would really appreciate any reviews from you !",
